<title>USA: Bandag to acquire stake in Joe Esco Tire.</title>
<headline>Bandag to acquire stake in Joe Esco Tire.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandag Inc said Thursday it agreed to acquire a minority interest in Joe Esco Tire Co, which operates 19 tire centers, including seven Bandag franchises, in Oklahoma, Texas, Arkansas, and Missouri.</p>
<p>Terms of the proposed agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bandag makes retreading materials and equipment for its worldwide network of over 1,300 independent franchised dealers who produce and market cold process retreads.</p>
<p>Shares of Bandag were trading unchanged at 51-1/4.</p>
<p>		     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
